    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19427" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾰρύ-θῡμος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>heavy in spirit: indignant,
				sullen,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀργή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Med.</u>
					176
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Cer.</u>
				81
			</span></i>, etc.; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξύθυμος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.13e
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Ir.</u>
				p.64
			</span></i> W. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μως, ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					2.3
				</span></i>
			; rejected by <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.99
			</span></i>.</div>
